    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef1d1c4304e09426",
      "translationZh": "下面，我们将介绍三种我们认为适合使用这种远程 VAE 推理的用例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "340f463033e0fd5d",
      "translationZh": "代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ac4d4535efd3ab4",
      "translationZh": "首先，我们创建了一个用于与远程 VAE 交互的辅助方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b199f0ebc59d2817",
      "translationZh": "从 main 分支安装 diffusers 以运行代码。pip install git+https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers@main",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "340f463033e0fd5d",
      "translationZh": "代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
